OL,3,ABulgaria investigates fire at weapons
OL,4,Asite that owner calls sabotage
OL,5,
OL,6,FBulgaria is investigating the cause of
OL,7,Fan overnight fire at an ammunition
OL,8,Fstorage site run by a private defence
OL,9,Fcompany.
OL,11,FInterior Minister Ivan Demerdzhiev said
OL,12,Fthe authorities "are not ruling out
OL,13,Foutside interference" in the incident
OL,14,Fin central Bulgaria. No-one was injured
OL,15,Fin the blaze that triggered a series of
OL,16,Fexplosions.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
