OL,3,ABulgaria investigates fire at weapons
OL,4,Asite that owner calls sabotage
OL,5,
OL,6,FEMCO company, whose weapons are used by
OL,7,FUkraine against invading Russian
OL,8,Fforces, said the fire at its site was
OL,9,Fsabotage and that human error was
OL,10,F"completely ruled out". It did not say
OL,11,Fwho might be responsible.
OL,13,FThe latest incident follows last
OL,14,Fmonth's fire and blasts at another EMCO
OL,15,Fammunition warehouse in the area.
